WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.669
Hello, friend.

00:00:00.669 --> 00:00:03.011
There's a film I want to finish.

00:00:03.011 --> 00:00:04.683
I remember the last scene.

00:00:04.683 --> 00:00:08.697
I shouldn't have to remember which shelf an app put it on.

00:00:08.697 --> 00:00:12.711
Let's connect two apps so you can pick the story back up.

00:00:12.711 --> 00:00:13.715
Stremio is optional.

00:00:13.715 --> 00:00:15.722
Your TV channels work either way.

00:00:16.042 --> 00:00:18.570
On your Fire TV, open Downloader.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:22.784
Visit the official Stremio downloads page linked below this video.

00:00:22.784 --> 00:00:24.891
Choose Android TV, then Latest.

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:29.105
Under Manual install, choose the ARM package for your device.

00:00:29.105 --> 00:00:29.948
Select Install.

00:00:29.948 --> 00:00:32.055
Open Stremio and sign in.

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:34.382
Now switch back to TT tv.

00:00:34.382 --> 00:00:37.394
Open My Library and select Sign in to Stremio.

00:00:37.394 --> 00:00:39.401
Leave the television on that screen.

00:00:39.401 --> 00:00:41.743
On your phone, scan its QR code.

00:00:41.743 --> 00:00:44.085
Sign in with the same Stremio account.

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:47.097
Enter the four characters you see on your television.

00:00:47.417 --> 00:00:51.111
In TT tv, find a Stremio film or episode.

00:00:51.111 --> 00:00:52.753
Press Watch on Stremio.

00:00:52.753 --> 00:00:53.984
See the change?

00:00:53.984 --> 00:00:56.858
You chose the story in TT tv.

00:00:56.858 --> 00:01:00.142
Now you're choosing the playback source inside Stremio.

00:01:00.142 --> 00:01:05.888
When you come back, use Stremio account, then Sync now, to refresh your library.

00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:09.062
If your source already works, you're done.

00:01:09.062 --> 00:01:12.324
Torrentio is an optional community add-on for Stremio.

00:01:12.324 --> 00:01:13.955
It lists torrent sources.

00:01:13.955 --> 00:01:19.255
To configure it, open the link below on a computer with Stremio installed.

00:01:19.255 --> 00:01:21.701
Choose your preferred language and resolution.

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:24.555
Pick material you have permission to watch.

00:01:24.875 --> 00:01:27.064
Real-Debrid is a separate, paid service.

00:01:27.064 --> 00:01:32.173
If you already use it and trust the add-on, select RealDebrid under Debrid Provider.

00:01:32.173 --> 00:01:35.457
Use Find API Key to get your own key.

00:01:35.457 --> 00:01:38.011
That key opens part of your account.

00:01:38.011 --> 00:01:40.930
Keep it and the installation link to yourself.

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.118
Select Install in the configurator.

00:01:43.118 --> 00:01:44.985
When Stremio opens, confirm Install.

00:01:44.985 --> 00:01:48.347
Reopen Stremio on the television with the same account.

00:01:48.347 --> 00:01:49.467
Try your film.

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:52.455
And when somebody asks how you did it?

00:01:52.455 --> 00:01:53.202
Show them.

00:01:53.202 --> 00:01:58.805
Knowing which button to press feels a lot better when you can pass it on.

